In article <45267@hydra.gatech.EDU> tad@prism.gatech.EDU (Tad K. Mannes) writes:
>I don't know if this has been discussed before but has anyone tried morphing
>into a Troll and get killed to see if you get resurrected.  I'm sure that
>you would simply die, but it would be neat if you didn't :)

Well, it won't work for a fairly simple reason.  When you polymorph into 
another creature, and then as that creature you get down to zero hit points,
you don't die in any case.  You simply change back to your human form.
There's no way to actually get killed while you're another monster type.

